{"synopsis":"Hunter terbaik Korea Selatan, ‘Mad Dog’ Min Si-woo.\n\nSaat ia dan murid-muridnya mengalahkan Raja Iblis! Ia dikirim ke dunia lain, dan setelah 100 tahun bertempur di alam yang dipenuhi monster, ia akhirnya kembali ke Bumi!\n\n“Tapi mengapa semua orang melupakanku?”\n\n100 tahun di dunia lain hanyalah 10 tahun di Bumi. Sekarang, seorang veteran berpengalaman yang telah ditempa oleh pertumpahan darah selama satu abad, Min Si-woo berangkat untuk menemukan murid-muridnya yang hilang dan mengungkap alasan di balik pemusnahannya!","alternative_title":"The Veteran Healer Is Overpowered","author":"Awonit","artist":"Kang Hari","chapters":[{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"6c4b8621-e94e-4031-911a-b92392b4db49","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"31a19cb1-4ac0-4f02-a86a-08ea142ea11d","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"e5f1b7ed-d4b3-457f-9ec5-c0578e0ba2e1","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"28abf0c1-35fd-434d-be39-ca6bf5d9c046","date":"2026-05-31","images":[]},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"c3a9b9ae-74e7-4701-a09d-ae90ad942a01","date":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"a8ed1a0d-ab17-4719-862f-c8761133c228","date":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"number":"77","chapter":"77","slug":"414ac113-535e-42e0-9557-1b2d19828c75","date":"2026-05-04","images":[]},{"number":"76","chapter":"76","slug":"39ebc7d6-a302-426e-973d-e7d9300d985c","date":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"number":"75","chapter":"75","slug":"3d310eff-70a1-46ae-af5f-c87b9a738f0a","date":"2026-04-28","images":[]},{"number":"74","chapter":"74","slug":"78cad270-cf70-421c-9026-31996b0cb4d4","date":"2026-04-20","images":[]},{"number":"73","chapter":"73","slug":"868871fb-3c32-475c-b0fa-88a2d121066f","date":"2026-04-20","images":[]},{"number":"72","chapter":"72","slug":"bf2d7f5c-f8cc-440b-9f36-fe59d17b3e79","date":"2026-03-27","images":[]},{"number":"71","chapter":"71","slug":"1d